<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_matrix__uint2x2_8hpp">glm/ext/matrix_uint2x2.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Defines a number of matrices with integer types.</para>
</section>
